This repository depends on, and in one place derives from, the Percolator
projects, all licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

* matcher/program is derived from percolator-match
  (https://github.com/aeyakovenko/percolator-match) at commit 60aac3a,
  Copyright 2025 Anatoly Yakovenko. Its licence is matcher/LICENSE; the
  changes are listed at the top of matcher/program/src/lib.rs.

* The Rust crates build against the Percolator engine
  (https://github.com/aeyakovenko/percolator) and its Solana wrapper
  (https://github.com/aeyakovenko/percolator-prog), at the forks and commits
  pinned in scripts/pins.env. Their source is not included here: Cargo and
  scripts/fetch_upstream.sh fetch it, with its own LICENSE files.

* frontend/src/chain encodes and decodes the wrapper's instruction and
  account layouts. It was written against the pinned wrapper; no upstream
  code is copied.

Price data is read from public sources at run time (OpenRouter's public
model endpoints list; the pinned scorer data listed in
flop-index/pins/*/SOURCES, which is downloaded from its sources and not
included here). This project is not affiliated with Flop Labs (FLOP
Network) or OpenRouter.
